OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F373A1786216690
OL,3,CBrooklands Museum celebrates 100 years
OL,4,Csince Britain's first Grand Prix
OL,6,FCars driven by racing legends such as
OL,7,FTim Birkin, Sir Henry Segrave, Dick
OL,8,FSeaman, Sir Stirling Moss, Graham
OL,9,FHill, Michael Schumacher and Sir Lewis
OL,10,FHamilton are also on display.
OL,12,FAlex Patterson, Chief executive of
OL,13,FBrooklands Museum, told ITV News
OL,14,FLondon: "Brooklands Museum is rooted
OL,15,Fin motorsport and aviation history.
OL,17,F"In a short space of time between 1907
OL,18,Fand 1939, the circuit really
OL,19,Ftransformed Britain's automotive
OL,20,Findustry and importantly, put us on
OL,21,Fthe world stage for motorsport as well.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/5
